msgstr[1] "Importados %1$d de %2$d días desde SlimStat."

#: importers/class-slimstat-importer.php:283
msgid ""
"Brings across daily pageviews and visitors, your pages, referrers, which "
"posts each referrer sent readers to, countries, browsers, operating systems,"
" devices, missing pages, downloads and outbound clicks, and the crawlers "
